      "writtenOn": "2022-03-29T03:28:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I agree that we could do this for both TCP and UDP.\nI rarely think that there will be backwards compatibility implications with behaviors you suggested nevertheless I\u0027ll add SDK version condition check to this new logic for certainty.",
      "parentUuid": "624c384f_5f01b1ab",
