      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks.\n\nAs for backwards compatibility, I\u0027ll leave that up to you. I just wanted to make sure you\u0027d considered the it.\n\nIf you think the SDK check is not needed, I think it\u0027s OK not to add it. Adding an SDK check definitely makes the code more complex and difficult to follow, and that will make it hard to maintain in the future, so it only makes sense to have an SDK check if we think the change in behaviour could break an existing client.",
