      "writtenOn": "2022-03-29T03:28:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the way that you suggested on the design doc.\nCellular network may provide a filter including only port without address.\nIn this case, telephony will use wild card address as a parameter of this method to check match of port without comparing address.\n\nThis will not break existing client.",
